 use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Saying What You Prefer", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use verbs with Infinitives like <span class=\"italic\">want to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">need to</span> to talk about what you prefer to do. </br>You can use the structure <span class=\"strong\">prefer to + (verb)</span> or <span class=\"strong\">prefer + (verb-ing)</span> to say what you prefer in general.<br>   The structure after <span class=\"strong\">prefer </span> can be:<br>  <br>I prefer something to something else.<br>  <span class=\"italic\">Example: I prefer swimming to running.<br></span>  <br> I prefer to do something rather than (do) something else.<br>  <span class=\"italic\">Example: I prefer to walk rather than run.</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I don't like jogging. <span class=\"strong\">I prefer</span> to go for long walks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes, <span class=\"strong\">I prefer</span> to sit at a park and people watch.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Colosseum", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a famous ancient Roman structure ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did I also say that I was visiting the Colosseum in Rome too?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk about tourist activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "local ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who lives in the same area for a long time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to meet the local people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "people watch", "type": "name"}, {"content": "spending time in one place watching people  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sometimes, I prefer to sit in a park and people watch.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cuisine ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a style of cooking from a particular area or region ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Trying new cuisine is always fun!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "countdown ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the final moments before an event ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The countdown is on!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to mention", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to say something briefly or by accident  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did I mention that I would like to see Rome?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Identify the city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an introductory sentence (a sentence that says what the blog is about).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 sentences about the city's attractions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 1 sentence about what you prefer to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a sentence that concludes the blog.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your blog aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify the city and write an introductory sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about attractions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about what I prefer to do in a city.", "type": "text"}]}]}